  "description": "SIRMUE crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group I -4. Reported CIF formula moiety: C90 H100 N16 O50 Tb8,14(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb1A (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb2A (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb1B (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb2B (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb1C (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb2C (Tb) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.603-5.174 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 89.68-179.86°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Tb8(μ3-O)4(L)8(CH3COO)4(CO3)2]·14H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
